 "ez_index": 231,
 "name": "ST40MILITARY.BBQ",
 "strings": [
  "",
  "Comms Officer",
  "\"Captain!",
  " Urgent transmission from Jaburo!\"",
  "Synapse",
  "\"Later!\"",
  "\"Ah, no, sir.",
  " Someone's cutting into the line!",
  " This is...!\"",
  "Delaz",
  "\"Earth Federation Forces, and",
  " warriors of Zeon, hear me.\"",
  "\"We are",
  " the 'Delaz Fleet.'\"",
  "\"!",
  " ...The Delaz Fleet!?\"",
  "\"The so-called 'One Year War,'",
  " the 'Zeon War of Independence'--\"",
  "\"its truce is a sham, as is plain",
  " for all to see.\"",
  "\"For that truce was signed",
  " by traitors usurping the name",
  " of the 'Republic of Zeon.'\"",
  "\"We have not lost sight in the",
  " least of why we fight.\"",
  "\"That will soon",
  " be proven.\"",
  "\"Day after day, I have thought\"",
  "\"of those who believed in self-rule",
  " for the space colonists, and were",
  " consumed by the fires of war.\"",
  "\"And now, once more,\"",
  "\"of the young who dare",
  " to leap into",
  " those flames...\"",
  "\"In answer to the space colonists'",
  " heartfelt demand for self-rule,\"",
  "\"the Federation intends to wield",
  " its vast military might",
  " to pluck that modest bud.\"",
  "\"I possess facts enough",
  " to prove it.\"",
  "\"Behold!",
  " This is our prize of war.\"",
  "\"This Gundam",
  " was developed for",
  " the purpose of nuclear attack.\"",
  "\"Given that this machine, which",
  " breaks the Antarctic Treaty, was",
  " developed in secret,\"",
  "\"who can deny",
  " the malice of the accursed",
  " Federation!?\"",
  "\"Let us reflect.",
  " Why did the 'Zeon War",
  " of Independence' break out?\"",
  "\"And why do we",
  " stand together with",
  " Zeon Zum Deikun...?\"",
  "\"We have waited three years.",
  " Now none in our ranks heaves",
  " a single sigh of hesitation.\"",
  "\"Now, the hot blood of true youth",
  " I take as my own blood,\"",
  "\"and here I declare war anew",
  " upon the government",
  " of the Earth Federation.\"",
  "\"Be not swayed",
  " by the whispers",
  " of a false peace,\"",
  "\"for the 'homeland's honor' that",
  " keeps ringing in our hearts...\"",
  "\"...Sieg Zeon.\""
 ]
}
